WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:18.151
- [clears throat]

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:21.220
- HEY.
WHAT...WHAT CAN I GET YOU?

00:00:21.253 --> 00:00:25.758
- HELLO, SIR.
I WOULD LIKE A RUM AND COKE.

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:27.994
- RUM AND COKE COMING UP.

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:33.132
- [groaning]

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:35.201
AHH, HEY.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:38.871
WHERE YOU FROM?

00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:40.206
ALL RIGHT, BABY.

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:42.442
I'M GONNA SEE YOU
ON THE DANCE FLOOR, GIRL.

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:45.211
OH! AH.

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:46.846
- HERE'S RUM AND COKE.
IT'S GONNA BE $8.

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:48.414
- $8, ALL RIGHT, MY GOOD MAN.

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:52.185
LET ME...[exhales]

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:56.089
[screams in agony]
WALLET, YEAH!

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:58.491
- [shushes]
- WHOO!

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:00.426
LET ME--I'MA GOT IT--I GOT IT.

00:01:00.459 --> 00:01:02.095
[bleep]!
- OH! SHH!

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.330
- AW, [bleep], MY WALLET!
- HEY, HEY, HEY, HEY, COME ON.

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:06.232
- HEY, YOU ALL RIGHT?
- OKAY, I'M--

00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:08.034
- YOU ALL RIGHT?
- WHEW!

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.302
[laughs]
I TELL YOU WHAT.

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:10.536
THIRD TIME'S THE CHARM, BROTHER.

00:01:10.569 --> 00:01:13.272
[panting]

00:01:13.305 --> 00:01:17.043
[screams in pain]

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:18.611
YOU WANT SOME HELP?
THERE IT IS.

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:20.012
THERE IT IS.
- YEAH, YEAH.

00:01:20.045 --> 00:01:21.347
YEAH, JUST TAKE THE CARD OUT.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:23.549
KEEP THAT OPEN FOR ME.
CAN YOU HANG ON TO THAT FOR ME?

00:01:23.582 --> 00:01:24.684
- WILL DO.

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.619 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
- IN FACT, LET ME GET

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.619 size:88% position:44%
A TEQUILA SHOT, BROTHER.

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:28.054
ACTUALLY, MAKE IT TWO, MAN.

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:30.323
ONE FOR ME,
AND ONE FOR YOU, MY GOOD MAN.

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:31.924
[screams in agony]

00:01:31.957 --> 00:01:34.260
- ALL RIGHT.

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:36.429
TWO TEQUILA SHOTS
COMING RIGHT UP.

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:38.297
- HOW YOU DOING, GIRL?

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:40.233
ALL RIGHT, NECTAR OF THE GODS

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.534
UP IN HERE.
- ALL RIGHT.

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:43.836
- ALL RIGHT,
LET'S GET THAT GOING NOW.

00:01:43.869 --> 00:01:44.971
ALL RIGHT, CHEERS.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.472
- YEAH, MAN.
- ALL RIGHT,<i> MI AMIGO.</i>

00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:49.142
- CHEERS.

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:51.244
- [screams]

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:53.012
WHOO!

00:01:53.045 --> 00:01:54.013
AH!

00:01:54.046 --> 00:01:55.248
- IS--LEAVE--
- NO, NO, HOLD ON.

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:56.782
THERE'S MORE THAN ONE WAY
TO SKIN A CAT.

00:01:56.815 --> 00:01:57.984
- YOU WANT SOME HELP
WITH THAT?

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.118
- HOLD UP, LET ME JUST
TRY TO GET UP IN HERE.

00:01:59.151 --> 00:02:01.621
- OH, MY GOD.
- [screams]

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.789
- OH, THAT'S--
- OH, THAT'S BURNING MY TONGUE.

00:02:03.822 --> 00:02:05.858
- YOU KNOW WHAT?
- WHAT? AHH.

00:02:05.891 --> 00:02:06.859
- I'M GONNA
GET YOU ONE OF THESE.

00:02:06.892 --> 00:02:08.027
- YEAH?
- TRY THAT.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.896
- THERE WE--ALL RIGHT.
HELL, YOU A GENIUS.

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:12.832
LET ME GET THIS GOING ON HERE.

00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:17.069
OKAY.

00:02:17.102 --> 00:02:18.204
- YOU JUST--THERE YOU GO.

00:02:18.237 --> 00:02:21.807
- MM-HMM.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:23.976
- WHOO!
<i> VAYA CON DIOS,</i> MY DARLING.

00:02:24.009 --> 00:02:24.977
THAT'S--
- ALL RIGHT.

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:26.245
- WHOO! ALL RIGHT.

00:02:26.278 --> 00:02:27.813
<i> MUCHOS GRACIAS.</i>
- YUP.

00:02:27.846 --> 00:02:29.982
HEY.
- YEAH.

00:02:30.015 --> 00:02:31.751
[grunts]
UH-HUH?

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:33.352
- SO I'M WORRIED ABOUT YOU.

00:02:33.385 --> 00:02:34.754
- OH, NO, I'M GONNA TELL YOU
WHAT I'M WORRIED ABOUT.

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.222
I'M WORRIED THAT THIS CLUB

00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:38.791
AIN'T POPPING OFF THE WAY
IT SHOULD BE! WHAT? WHAT?

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:40.660
[screams]
'CAUSE I--WAIT A SECOND.

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:42.862
[rap song plays in background]
WHAT? UH-OH.

00:02:42.895 --> 00:02:44.564
DJ, TURN IT UP!

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.098
THAT'S MY TRACK RIGHT THERE.

00:02:46.131 --> 00:02:49.435
UH-HUH. WHAT IT IS!

00:02:49.468 --> 00:02:51.537
AAH!

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:54.073
HA-HAAAAH!

00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:56.142
[grunts]
UNGH! OH!

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:57.843
[laughs]

00:02:57.876 --> 00:03:00.379
[trills tongue and laughs]

00:03:00.412 --> 00:03:01.480
- HEY, MAN,

00:03:01.513 --> 00:03:03.349
A BAR IS NOT THE PLACE
FOR YOU TO BE RIGHT NOW.

00:03:03.382 --> 00:03:07.086
- [screams]

00:03:07.119 --> 00:03:09.522
WHOO, WHOO.

00:03:09.555 --> 00:03:11.224
LET ME--LET ME GET
TWO MORE SHOTS OF TEQUILA.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.491
- UNH-UH.

00:03:12.524 --> 00:03:13.726
SORRY, PAL, YOU'RE 86'ED.

00:03:13.759 --> 00:03:15.361
- WHAT? HOW?
WHAT NOW?

00:03:15.394 --> 00:03:16.562
AND WHAT--THAT'S PREPOSTEROUS.

00:03:16.595 --> 00:03:20.499
- LET'S GO, BUDDY.
- [screams]

00:03:20.532 --> 00:03:21.734
- BE--BE GENTLE WITH HIM.

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:24.770
- RIGHT THIS WAY.
- AYE! AYE! AAH!

00:03:24.803 --> 00:03:26.806
OH, IT HURTS ALL OVER!

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:28.208
HOW YOU DOING, GIRL?
[screams]

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:34.180
- FIRST TIME, I THINK WAS,
LIKE, '87.

00:03:34.213 --> 00:03:38.117
IT WAS TWO GUYS
IN A HEAVYWEIGHT BOUT. YEAH.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.553
NO, IT WAS THE FIRST TIME
IN A HEAVYWEIGHT BOUT

00:03:40.586 --> 00:03:45.091
THAT THE TWO FIGHTERS
ENDED UP GETTING MARRIED.

00:03:45.124 --> 00:03:47.193
- [Spanish accent]
HELLO, MY GOOD SIR.

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:50.763
I'D LIKE TO HAVE TWO SHOTS
OF TEQUILA.

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:57.470
[screams in agony]
COME ON, BROTHER!

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:59.639
WHY YOU GOTTA--
[groans]

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:00.807
OH, MAN, THAT HURTS.

